<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <body>
    <table style="width: 100%; float: left; border: 5px solid #0000000d; padding: 0px 10px;" border="0">
      <tr>
        <td>
          <img src="{{SERVER_DOMAIN_NAME_HEADER}}" style="width: 100%;">
        </td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td>
          <p>Dear {{name}},</p>
          <p></p>

          <p>I hope you are doing well.</p>

          <p>
            Please remember that there are many benefits to repaying the loan amount on or before due date.
            If you make timely payment then:
          </p>

          <p>1. You will save penal interest.</p>
          <p>2. Your CIBIL score will definitely improve.</p>
          <p>3. You may prevent any legal action.</p>
          <p>4. You may be eligible to get loan from any company in India.</p>

          <p>
            Timely payment can help develop further our mutual relations, so in any time of emergency you can
            approach us for a loan and get preferred treatment.
          </p>

          <p>
            That is the reason we had agreed and aligned your repayment day with your salary date so that you
            can pay easily and avoid all the above hassles.
          </p>

          <p>Please ignore this message if you have already paid meanwhile.</p>

          <p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>

          <p>Best regards,</p>
          <p>{{companyName}} Recovery Team</p>
          <p>Contact with us for any further inquiry</p>
        </td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td>
          <img src="{{SERVER_DOMAIN_NAME_FOOTER}}" style="width: 100%;">
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
